OL,3,GNEWSACharity warns recycling plant
OL,4,Arisking cycle route
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cycling charity has warned part of a
OL,7,Fcycle route could be removed from the
OL,8,FNational Cycle Network if plans to
OL,9,Fexpand a recycling site lead to more
OL,10,Florries using the road.
OL,12,FNorth West Recycling wants to increase
OL,13,Fwaste-processing capacity at its site
OL,14,Fnear Rockliffe, north of Carlisle, in
OL,15,FCumbria.
OL,17,FWalk Wheel Cycle Trust said an increase
OL,18,Fin heavy goods vehicles on National
OL,19,FCycle Route 7 between Cargo and
OL,20,FRockcliffe was expected, prompting
OL,21,Fsafety concerns, and called for
OL,22,Fimprovements to protect cyclists.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
